      "content": "i know i shouldn't just take more but it's honestly unbearable and i'm kinda scared lol. like i've never had it hit this hard before, it felt like a literal clap of thunder in my head. but since i know i get migraines all the time, i figured it's just a flare up. do you think it's worth going to the ER or can i just try a higher dose of the sumatriptan and see if it helps? i'd rather not wait in a waiting room for hours if it's just a migraine.",
